# Implementation Plan: GAS Email Notification Bridge

Set up an automated notification system where every public form submission sends a detailed email and saves data to a Google Sheet.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Email Destinations**: I'll use `blendedlearningschoolpk@gmail.com` as the primary destination. If you have a second specific email for the Principal, please let me know.
> - **GAS Script Setup**: I have provided the source code below. You will need to paste this into your [Google Apps Script Editor](https://script.google.com/).
